B.b2j=A.a(s(["Mandell LA et al. IDSA/ATS Consensus Guidelines on Community-Acquired Pneumonia. CID. 2007;44(Suppl 2):S27\u2013S72.","Annane D et al. Effect of treatment with low doses of hydrocortisone and fludrocortisone on mortality in patients with septic shock. JAMA. 2002.","Gu\xe9rin C et al. Prone Positioning in Severe Acute Respiratory Distress Syndrome (PROSEVA). NEJM. 2013;368(23):2159\u20132168.","Waterer GW et al. Dual antibiotic therapy for community-acquired pneumonia in ICU. AJRCCM. 2001.","UpToDate: Treatment of community-acquired pneumonia in adults who require hospitalization. 2024."]),t.s)
