B.bkd=A.a(s(["Villanueva C et al. Transfusion strategies for acute upper GI bleeding (restrictive vs. liberal). NEJM. 2013;368(1):11\u201321.","Gralnek IM et al. Management of acute nonvariceal upper gastrointestinal bleeding. Endoscopy. 2015;47(10):a1\u201346.","National Institute for Health and Care Excellence (NICE). Acute upper gastrointestinal bleeding. Guideline. 2012 (updated 2016).","UpToDate: Management of acute upper gastrointestinal bleeding related to a peptic ulcer. 2024."]),t.s)
